Package: ezra-lang
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 8192
Maintainer: Ankur Rana <ankur@ranaji114.github.io>
Homepage: https://ranaji114.github.io/Flux-programming-lang
Description: Ezra scripting language interpreter
 Ezra is a readable, indentation-based scripting language built in Rust.
 .
 Features:
  - Clean natural syntax: `name is "Rana"`, `check if age >= 18`
  - Built-in formatter, linter, test runner, REPL
  - File I/O, JSON, math, OS builtins
  - VS Code extension with syntax highlighting and LSP
 .
 Created by Ankur Rana.
 Repository: https://github.com/ranaji114/Flux-programming-lang
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Recommends: code
Suggests: ezra-lang-vscode
